WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs wide in a comfortable V.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Turn the torso toward the right leg and lengthen the spine.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach for the right foot with both hands or a strap.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Fold gently over the right leg, keeping both sit bones grounded.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then return to center and switch sides.
